MODIFIED_FILE adds a resumable single-key model probe against the current local todo2api gateway.

Changed branch:
- Query the authenticated /v1/models catalog.
- Skip models already recorded as successful.
- Call /v1/chat/completions once per remaining model.
- Persist every result immediately and stop if the sole account enters HTTP 503 cooldown.

Changed fields:
- model
- status
- http_status
- latency_seconds
- response_preview
- declared_context
- declared_max_completion

No raw upstream API key is written to the script, JSON results, or report.
